{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39831","headline":"题胡州太学丘光庭博士幽居 · 殷文圭","name":"题胡州太学丘光庭博士幽居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"舜轨尧文混九垓，明堂宏构集良材。\n江边云卧如龙稳，天外泥书遣鹤来。\n五夜药苗滋沆瀣，四时花影荫莓苔。\n草玄门似山中静，不是公卿到不开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷文圭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39831.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39831","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}